[
  {
    "id": "b56356cc3bc0df54d794",
    "source": "Take a romance one step further: interested (a quiet, unspoken pull), courting (declared out loud), together (partners), betrothed (a proposal), married (wed). Call it BEFORE narrating how it goes. After the checks the romance rules describe, the server decides whether they accept, rolling when it is genuinely uncertain. One step per exchange. An NPC's move (initiator npc) goes only toward a character open to advances, and the character's player answers it.",
    "sourceHash": "b56356cc3bc0df54d794edbd1b1b3088fad76152562c91359c01dbe283c2f80d",
